  "_why": "Cory ruled 2026-08-19 'ship roster builder but i want to be able to turn it off also'. CFG.ROSTER_SHAPE=true adds his transcribed roster curve x (1-streamability) as a multiplicative shape factor, applied with Math.min so it can never rescue a negative score. The board legitimately changed at mid-two-rb-one-wr and late-onesies-open, which is where a roster-shape term is supposed to bite; v28 predates the term and cannot represent the shipped state. Evidence stated rather than implied: on 30 real seat-years the term is -20.4 pts/season on actual points and +7.9 on Cory's skill grade, and its preregistered bar P215 FAILS on both (14/30, 16/30 vs 18/30). Shipped on his ruling, not on a passing test. Known unfixed defect at freeze time: K/DEF taken ~30 picks early (register 127). Board also carries the 6-source blend with own_v6 removed."
